      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "title": "Parallelism",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653",
      "widgets_values": [
        "Ulysses splits the 4097 tokens (4096 latents and the time token) across the GPUs; the\ndefault here is 2.\n\nFor CFG parallel set cfg_degree 2 and ulysses_degree 1: the conditioned and the zeroed image condition run on\nseparate GPUs. With four GPUs both can be 2.\n\nFSDP is off: the 6.6 GB DiT fits on each 12 GB card next to the image encoder and the VAE decode this process\nruns on GPU 0 (about 7.2 GB peak on 2x RTX 3060). Turn it on for smaller cards; over PCIe its per-layer weight\ngathers cost speed (1.98 s/step with FSDP against 1.18 s/step without, on those cards)."
      ]
    },
