      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "title": "Hunyuan3D 2.1 on Raylight",
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653",
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Hunyuan3D 2.1 on Raylight\n\n**Model** from [Comfy-Org/hunyuan3D_2.1_repackaged](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/hunyuan3D_2.1_repackaged):\n- `checkpoints/hunyuan_3d_v2.1.safetensors` (7.4 GB). It holds the DiT, the image encoder and the VAE: the Ray workers\n  load the DiT from it, Load Checkpoint (Image Only) gives this process the encoder and the VAE.\n\n**Input image**: [3d_hunyuan3d-v2.1_input_image.png](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/refs/heads/main/input/3d_hunyuan3d-v2.1_input_image.png)\n\nSame graph and settings as ComfyUI's *Hunyuan3D 2.1 Image to Model* template, with the DiT on the Ray workers.\n\n**Hunyuan3D 2.0 / 2.0 mini** run on the same graph: pick `hunyuan3d-dit-v2_fp16.safetensors`\n([Comfy-Org/hunyuan3D_2.0_repackaged](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/hunyuan3D_2.0_repackaged)) in both loaders and use\nComfyUI's 2.0 settings: 3072 latents, 20 steps, cfg 8, crop `none`.\n"
      ]
    },
